      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Detached seven bedroom house.\r\nSpacious and well proportioned accommodation.\r\nGenerous surrounding gardens with a detached garage.\r\nLocated approximately 3km from Ballyboughal, 9km from Swords and 9km from Ashbourne.\r\nThe nearby M1 offers ease of access to Dublin Aiport, Dublin city centre and further afield.\r\nExtending to approximately 407 sq. m (4,381 sq. ft).\r\nOn a site area extending to approximately 0.22 hectares (0.54 acres).\r\nVacant possession.\r\n\r\nThis property provides a detached seven bedroom house with gardens to the front and rear. The property is arranged over ground and one upper floor beneath a pitched roof. This property offers off street parking. We are informed the property extends to approximately 407 sq. m (4,381 sq. ft).\r\n\r\nVacant Possession."
      },
